"""Build the final B7-B8 Word manuscript with quantitative petrography and source-error analysis.

Prerequisites in the same scripts directory:
- build_final_b7_b8_ensemble_manuscript_self_contained.py
- build_expanded_b7_b8_ensemble_manuscript.py
- 900-DPI Figures 1-4 generated by render_expanded_context_figures_900dpi.py
- native 900-DPI strong/typical/difficult ensemble figures under --ensemble-figure-root.

All new tables are native editable Word tables. No claim of 3D modal mineralogy, grain-contact
networks, porosity, or physical units is made from the current semantic maps.
"""
